---
---
<section class="shop" id="tienda">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head split">
            <div>
                <span class="eyebrow">Tienda Michicondrias</span>
                <h2>Todo lo que tu peludito necesita, <span class="accent">curado con cariño</span></h2>
                <p class="section-sub">De la croqueta diaria al rascador de diseño, pasando por la cama ortopédica y el bebedero inteligente. Y sí, tenemos un pasillo entero dedicado a michis.</p>
            </div>
            <a href="#tienda" class="btn btn-primary">Ir a la tienda</a>
        </div>
        <div class="shop-cats">
            <button class="shop-cat active" data-cat="all">🐾 Todo</button>
            <button class="shop-cat" data-cat="food">🍗 Alimento</button>
            <button class="shop-cat" data-cat="toys">🧶 Juguetes</button>
            <button class="shop-cat" data-cat="hygiene">🛁 Higiene</button>
            <button class="shop-cat" data-cat="comfort">🛏️ Confort</button>
            <button class="shop-cat" data-cat="tech">📡 Tecnología</button>
            <button class="shop-cat" data-cat="treats">🦴 Premios</button>
        </div>
        <div class="shop-grid">
            <article class="product" data-cat="food">
                <div class="product-thumb" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFD3A5, #FD9853)">
                    <span>🍗</span>
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <span class="product-tag">Michis</span>
                    <h4>Alimento premium gato salmón</h4>
                    <div class="product-meta">1.5 kg · Adulto</div>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="product-price">$ 389</span>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Agregar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="product" data-cat="toys">
                <div class="product-thumb" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C5A0FF, #8B5FBF)">
                    <span>🧶</span>
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <span class="product-tag">Michis</span>
                    <h4>Ratón interactivo inteligente</h4>
                    <div class="product-meta">USB · 3 modos</div>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="product-price">$ 549</span>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Agregar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="product" data-cat="comfort">
                <div class="product-thumb" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #A8E6CF, #4FB286)">
                    <span>🛏️</span>
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <span class="product-tag">Lomitos</span>
                    <h4>Cama ortopédica memory foam</h4>
                    <div class="product-meta">XL · Lavable</div>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="product-price">$ 1,299</span>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Agregar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="product" data-cat="tech">
                <div class="product-thumb" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #B5E0FF, #4A90E2)">
                    <span>📡</span>
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <span class="product-tag tag-hot">Hot</span>
                    <h4>Collar GPS 4G · 30 días batería</h4>
                    <div class="product-meta">Incluye SIM · 1 año</div>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="product-price">$ 1,899</span>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Agregar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="product" data-cat="hygiene">
                <div class="product-thumb" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFC2D1, #FF6B9D)">
                    <span>🛁</span>
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <span class="product-tag">Todos</span>
                    <h4>Shampoo hipoalergénico avena</h4>
                    <div class="product-meta">500 ml · Piel sensible</div>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="product-price">$ 219</span>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Agregar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="product" data-cat="treats">
                <div class="product-thumb" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE5A0, #F7B500)">
                    <span>🦴</span>
                </div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <span class="product-tag">Lomitos</span>
                    <h4>Snack dental natural pollo</h4>
                    <div class="product-meta">200 g · Surtido</div>
                    <div class="product-bottom">
                        <span class="product-price">$ 159</span>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Agregar</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
